• Bachelor's Degree and 2 years of experience; Master's Degree and 0 years of experience.
• Background in a life sciences industry&#xa0;and data science.
• Strong programming proficiency in Python required.&#xa0;
• SQL skills (basic queries, table creation, views, and reporting)&#xa0;
• Knowledge of statistical and data mining techniques&#xa0;
• Working knowledge of data flow/architecture and ETL&#xa0;
• Working knowledge of drug discovery and development process &#xa0;
• Ability to work independently and within timelines in a fast-paced environment, managing multiple priorities effectively.
• Addresses routine and some non-routine problems; communicates progress and results to supervisors.&#xa0;
• Outstanding verbal, written and interpersonal skills for cross-functional collaboration, including proofreading, editing, and formatting technical documentation, and documenting and presenting technical solutions to non-technical stakeholders.&#xa0;
• A self-motivated learner and thinker with a hands-on approach &#xa0;
